{
  "name": "Daily Competitor Google Ads Monitor to Slack (ClearStack Data Apify)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Daily Competitor Google Ads Monitor\n\n**How to set up (2 min):**\n1. Create an **HTTP Header Auth** credential: Header Name = `Authorization`, Value = `Bearer <YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN>`.\n2. Edit `targets` in the HTTP Request node (`stripe.com`, `shopify.com`, etc.) and `region` (`US`, `FR`, `GB`, `ALL`).\n3. Connect Slack, verify `#competitor-ads`, and activate the schedule.\n\nUses `onlyNewSinceLastRun: true` so you only get alerted (and billed) for brand-new ads.\nActor docs: https://apify.com/clearstack-data/google-ads-transparency-scraper",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333001",
      "name": "Setup Guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 9 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333002",
      "name": "Every Day at 09:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/clearstack-data~google-ads-transparency-scraper/run-sync-get-dataset-items?maxTotalChargeUsd=0.25",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\"targets\":[\"stripe.com\",\"shopify.com\",\"hubspot.com\"],\"region\":\"US\",\"format\":\"ALL\",\"dateRangeDays\":7,\"maxAdsPerTarget\":40,\"includeDetails\":false,\"onlyNewSinceLastRun\":true,\"monitorStateName\":\"competitors-us\"}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "id": "33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333003",
      "name": "Check New Competitor Google Ads",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "const rows = $input.all().filter(i => i.json && (i.json.creativeId || i.json.advertiserId));\nif (!rows.length) return [];\nconst lines = rows.slice(0, 15).map(i => {\n  const a = i.json;\n  return `- [${a.format}] *${a.advertiserName || a.domain}* (${a.firstShownDate || 'new'}) -> ${a.adUrl}`;\n});\nreturn [{ json: { text: (`*New Competitor Google Ads Detected (${rows.length})*\\n` + lines.join('\\n')).slice(0, 2800) } }];"
      },
      "id": "33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333004",
      "name": "Format Competitor Ad Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        740,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "#competitor-ads",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "text": "={{ $json.text }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333005",
      "name": "Send Alert to Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        980,
        300
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every Day at 09:00": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Check New Competitor Google Ads",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Check New Competitor Google Ads": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Format Competitor Ad Alert",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Format Competitor Ad Alert": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send Alert to Slack",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "pinData": {},
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  }
}
